2
00:00:15,968 --> 00:00:19,038
(Hong Seung Hee)

3
00:00:19,108 --> 00:00:22,278
(Lee Yi Kyung)

4
00:00:23,418 --> 00:00:25,518
(Park Yu Na)

5
00:00:36,628 --> 00:00:39,968
(Oh! My Guard)

6
00:00:40,028 --> 00:00:41,428
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

7
00:00:41,498 --> 00:00:42,968
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

8
00:00:46,938 --> 00:00:48,338
Why is my heart beating so fast?

9
00:00:49,608 --> 00:00:51,108
Is it just beating for no reason?

10
00:01:19,808 --> 00:01:21,008
I really found him.

11
00:01:24,338 --> 00:01:25,408
My father.

12
00:01:48,798 --> 00:01:50,498
You are my father, right?

13
00:01:50,568 --> 00:01:52,698
You really are my father, right?

14
00:01:52,768 --> 00:01:54,068
Hey, what is wrong with you?

15
00:01:55,168 --> 00:01:58,478
You have the wrong person. Go away.

16
00:01:58,538 --> 00:02:00,108
My Young Ji.

17
00:02:00,178 --> 00:02:04,548
No, no, not Young Ji. I am your daughter.

18
00:02:04,618 --> 00:02:05,618
Your daughter Hong Du...

19
00:02:05,678 --> 00:02:08,618
- No, let go of me.
- What should I do?

20
00:02:08,688 --> 00:02:09,788
Crazy woman.

21
00:02:13,328 --> 00:02:14,528
Father?

22
00:02:15,028 --> 00:02:16,028
Father.

23
00:02:35,708 --> 00:02:38,048
(Episode 5)

24
00:02:40,318 --> 00:02:43,488
You still have a lot of energy, sir.

25
00:02:46,928 --> 00:02:47,958
I saw you...

26
00:02:49,028 --> 00:02:50,598
at the hospital before.

27
00:03:00,968 --> 00:03:01,968
Ta-da.

28
00:03:02,038 --> 00:03:03,408
(The Cocky Detective and Con Artist)

29
00:03:03,708 --> 00:03:06,378
I play the con artist in this project.

30
00:03:06,448 --> 00:03:09,378
Na Ri, your face is unbelievably gorgeous.

31
00:03:09,448 --> 00:03:11,148
I suppose I am.

32
00:03:11,218 --> 00:03:15,048
Um Tae Bong plays the detective chasing me.

33
00:03:15,118 --> 00:03:17,818
Everyone, you will give our drama a lot of love, right?

34
00:03:17,888 --> 00:03:20,028
Um Tae Bong will dump you after the drama ends.

35
00:03:21,828 --> 00:03:23,458
Actually, in the show, my soul...

36
00:03:23,528 --> 00:03:27,168
- enters his body.
- Are you two really dating?

37
00:03:27,228 --> 00:03:28,498
That is so sad.

38
00:03:31,438 --> 00:03:33,208
It is true that we are dating, but...

39
00:03:33,268 --> 00:03:35,468
you all are much, much more precious to...

40
00:03:35,538 --> 00:03:38,308
No, they are probably not actually dating.

41
00:03:38,378 --> 00:03:40,078
It is all a lie.

42
00:03:41,608 --> 00:03:43,178
No, it is not.

43
00:03:43,248 --> 00:03:44,418
We really are dating.

44
00:03:44,478 --> 00:03:47,488
They have not even kissed. Really? No kissing means no dating.

45
00:03:47,548 --> 00:03:49,388
But why does Um Tae Bong not kiss in dramas?

46
00:03:49,448 --> 00:03:51,658
It is not that he does not do it, maybe he cannot do it?

47
00:03:51,718 --> 00:03:55,088
Is Um Tae Bong a defective human who cannot kiss?

48
00:03:55,158 --> 00:03:57,928
Hey, you, I am going to kick you out. Okay?

49
00:03:57,998 --> 00:04:00,728
He is not unable to kiss, okay? I would know.

50
00:04:00,798 --> 00:04:02,528
If you are really dating, reveal the secret...

51
00:04:02,598 --> 00:04:04,938
why Um Tae Bong does not film kiss scenes.

52
00:04:04,998 --> 00:04:07,268
Reveal it and we will believe you. If you are offended, drop dead.

53
00:04:08,268 --> 00:04:10,638
A Romance Master who cannot kiss? That is disgusting.

54
00:04:10,708 --> 00:04:12,178
Disgusting.

55
00:04:12,238 --> 00:04:14,848
You guys are more disgusting. Get out, all of you.

56
00:04:17,278 --> 00:04:19,018
(Na Ri TV has ended the broadcast.)

57
00:04:21,088 --> 00:04:22,518
There is definitely something going on.

58
00:04:30,328 --> 00:04:31,928
Oh my, when a man and a woman...

59
00:04:31,998 --> 00:04:34,228
see each other too often, they get attached.

60
00:04:34,298 --> 00:04:36,298
I will get straight to the point.

61
00:04:36,368 --> 00:04:38,898
This woman next to Um Tae Bong.

62
00:04:38,968 --> 00:04:41,168
This person is...

63
00:04:41,238 --> 00:04:44,278
Oh, is she a woman you know too, CEO Park?

64
00:04:44,338 --> 00:04:46,278
The fact they were photographed together at night...

65
00:04:46,348 --> 00:04:48,448
means she definitely has a special relationship with Um Star.

66
00:04:48,508 --> 00:04:49,508
No.

67
00:04:50,578 --> 00:04:51,948
She demanded money.

68
00:04:52,018 --> 00:04:54,488
In exchange for revealing the secret of why he does not film kiss scenes.

69
00:04:54,548 --> 00:04:56,118
Who? This person?

70
00:04:56,188 --> 00:04:58,088
We are supposed to meet this evening, but...

71
00:04:58,158 --> 00:05:01,758
I still have some loyalty. I came to you first, CEO Park.

72
00:05:01,828 --> 00:05:04,728
To see if you can persuade me.

73
00:05:04,798 --> 00:05:06,498
What is it, really?

74
00:05:06,568 --> 00:05:07,928
Um Star is hiding something, isn't he?

75
00:05:07,998 --> 00:05:09,128
Some unspeakable secret.

76
00:05:14,038 --> 00:05:15,038
Reporter Yeo.

77
00:05:28,488 --> 00:05:29,758
Oh, seriously.

78
00:05:29,818 --> 00:05:32,218
Asked for money? You have got the wrong person.

79
00:05:32,288 --> 00:05:35,488
She is not the type to make a deal using Tae Bong's secret.

80
00:05:35,558 --> 00:05:37,258
Oh, man, seriously.

81
00:05:37,328 --> 00:05:39,528
Man, I almost fell for that for a second.

82
00:05:39,598 --> 00:05:42,168
Nice try. I am busy, so I will be going.

83
00:05:42,228 --> 00:05:45,268
Okay. I admit my plan failed.

84
00:05:45,338 --> 00:05:47,738
But you almost fell for it?

85
00:05:49,008 --> 00:05:50,338
Then I got one thing out of this.

86
00:05:53,978 --> 00:05:58,448
That this woman might actually know Um Star's real secret?

87
00:05:58,518 --> 00:05:59,948
Are you not getting out? I am the one...

88
00:06:00,018 --> 00:06:01,018
who is actually busy now.

89
00:06:08,228 --> 00:06:09,228
Son of a...

90
00:06:15,498 --> 00:06:16,498
Here,

91
00:06:17,598 --> 00:06:18,598
I couldn't give this to you earlier.

92
00:06:19,938 --> 00:06:21,708
But what are you doing here?

93
00:06:21,768 --> 00:06:26,278
- I really saw my father earlier.
- There you go again. Oh, man.

94
00:06:30,378 --> 00:06:31,618
This.

95
00:06:31,678 --> 00:06:34,018
Dementia nursing hospital?

96
00:06:34,088 --> 00:06:36,118
- This is...
- It was on my father's arm earlier.

97
00:06:36,188 --> 00:06:39,558
Now it all makes sense. My father didn't die. He was just sick.

98
00:06:39,618 --> 00:06:41,228
If I search every nursing hospital in Seoul,

99
00:06:41,288 --> 00:06:42,288
I can find him.

100
00:06:45,258 --> 00:06:46,358
Do whatever you want, then.

101
00:06:48,168 --> 00:06:49,938
I shouldn't hate my father anymore.

102
00:06:52,068 --> 00:06:55,738
I missed him so much that I really hated him.

103
00:06:58,208 --> 00:06:59,338
But now...

104
00:07:01,578 --> 00:07:02,608
I don't hate him.

105
00:07:32,038 --> 00:07:34,408
Hey, Tae Bong, we have a big problem.

106
00:07:34,478 --> 00:07:35,548
Oh, Mr. Choi.

107
00:07:36,818 --> 00:07:37,818
Mr. Choi?

108
00:07:39,278 --> 00:07:40,618
What is Mr. Choi Gu doing here?

109
00:07:42,148 --> 00:07:44,288
Cha Hong Du is looking for him.

110
00:07:44,358 --> 00:07:46,418
- What?
- This was it.

111
00:07:46,488 --> 00:07:48,158
The whole story behind the fake world...

112
00:07:49,258 --> 00:07:50,258
that Cha Hong Du believes in.

113
00:07:50,328 --> 00:07:52,898
Wait, so why is Hong Du looking for him?

114
00:07:54,668 --> 00:07:56,738
Don't tell me she thinks he is her father?

115
00:08:00,538 --> 00:08:01,768
She is a woman who makes up context...

116
00:08:01,838 --> 00:08:04,908
- out of thin air.
- I don't know how...

117
00:08:04,978 --> 00:08:06,508
Reporter Yeo Mi Ran caught on,

118
00:08:06,578 --> 00:08:09,478
but she knows that Hong Du knows your secret.

119
00:08:10,548 --> 00:08:12,518
- What?
- She is going to find Hong Du...

120
00:08:12,578 --> 00:08:14,688
and make her talk.

121
00:08:14,748 --> 00:08:18,018
But does Hong Du really know your secret?

122
00:08:18,088 --> 00:08:19,458
The day you wore that paper bag over your head,

123
00:08:19,518 --> 00:08:22,258
did something actually happen between you two?

124
00:08:22,328 --> 00:08:23,828
What are you talking about?

125
00:08:23,898 --> 00:08:25,458
Cha Hong Du blackmailed you.

126
00:08:27,168 --> 00:08:29,528
Right, she did.

127
00:08:29,598 --> 00:08:31,238
Anyway, it is dangerous.

128
00:08:31,298 --> 00:08:34,108
Like you said, she is someone who makes up context out of thin air.

129
00:08:34,168 --> 00:08:35,168
It is dangerous, so dangerous.

130
00:08:35,238 --> 00:08:37,938
Who knows what kind of unpredictable trouble she will cause...

131
00:08:41,778 --> 00:08:43,148
I haven't found him yet,

132
00:08:44,318 --> 00:08:46,318
but I will soon.

133
00:08:46,378 --> 00:08:48,218
But it is a real miracle.

134
00:08:48,288 --> 00:08:50,818
You reunited with your father who you thought passed away.

135
00:08:50,888 --> 00:08:52,558
I know, right?

136
00:08:52,618 --> 00:08:53,888
Ever since I woke up in the hospital,

137
00:08:53,958 --> 00:08:55,258
only good things have been happening.

138
00:08:55,328 --> 00:08:57,298
I am working again,

139
00:08:57,358 --> 00:08:59,258
and I found out my father is alive.

140
00:09:02,998 --> 00:09:04,868
Why are you leaving me out?

141
00:09:09,538 --> 00:09:12,778
The best thing of all is...

142
00:09:12,838 --> 00:09:14,478
getting a good neighbour?

143
00:09:14,548 --> 00:09:15,548
A neighbour?

144
00:09:18,278 --> 00:09:19,278
What is that?

145
00:09:27,928 --> 00:09:28,928
Give it here.

146
00:09:30,658 --> 00:09:32,558
I thought you lived off these when you worked part-time.

147
00:09:33,768 --> 00:09:34,768
Tell me the truth.

148
00:09:34,768 --> 00:09:36,668
Are you actually a conglomerate heiress?

149
00:09:36,738 --> 00:09:37,868
And you have never eaten anything like this?

150
00:09:39,268 --> 00:09:41,368
How did you know? Actually...

151
00:09:44,908 --> 00:09:49,378
I just temporarily...

152
00:09:49,448 --> 00:09:51,478
escaped from my castle.

153
00:09:51,548 --> 00:09:52,548
I knew it.

154
00:09:54,788 --> 00:09:55,918
Which castle is it?

155
00:09:57,058 --> 00:09:58,458
Just tell me. It will be our secret.

156
00:10:00,128 --> 00:10:01,788
This is a huge secret, but...

157
00:10:03,298 --> 00:10:04,298
Actually...

158
00:10:05,328 --> 00:10:06,358
It is Mr. Han's company.

159
00:10:15,608 --> 00:10:17,078
Then you must be Oh Hae Ra, Hong Du.

160
00:10:18,138 --> 00:10:19,838
Oh Hae Ra? Who is that?

161
00:10:24,278 --> 00:10:26,618
The one you said you really wanted to be friends with last time?

162
00:10:26,688 --> 00:10:28,248
You are completely obsessed with her.

163
00:10:28,318 --> 00:10:29,388
You do not even know what she looks like.

164
00:10:30,918 --> 00:10:32,388
Oh Hae Ra...

165
00:10:32,458 --> 00:10:34,888
If we ever meet, she will fall right for me.

166
00:10:38,658 --> 00:10:40,798
Wow, you are so full of yourself.

167
00:10:40,868 --> 00:10:42,368
I will go wash this off.

168
00:10:46,938 --> 00:10:47,968
She is cute.

169
00:10:54,048 --> 00:10:56,448
(Evil Employer)

170
00:11:01,418 --> 00:11:02,418
Yes, hello...

171
00:11:02,488 --> 00:11:05,288
I am only going to ask you this one last time,

172
00:11:05,358 --> 00:11:07,328
so you are dead if you lie.

173
00:11:07,388 --> 00:11:12,258
Did you really blackmail CEO Park? It just does not make any sense.

174
00:11:12,328 --> 00:11:14,028
Why did you play dumb with me after doing that?

175
00:11:15,068 --> 00:11:16,698
Do you...

176
00:11:16,768 --> 00:11:20,268
actually know my secret, or not?

177
00:11:20,338 --> 00:11:21,338
Are you not going to answer?

178
00:11:23,508 --> 00:11:25,208
You are not giving me a chance to speak.

179
00:11:27,878 --> 00:11:30,118
Who are you?

180
00:11:30,178 --> 00:11:31,178
Where is Cha Hong Du?

181
00:11:31,248 --> 00:11:34,518
I am someone who lives with Hong Du. As for Hong Du,

182
00:11:37,018 --> 00:11:38,158
she went to wash up.

183
00:11:39,188 --> 00:11:41,128
What? Wash up?

184
00:11:41,188 --> 00:11:43,398
Yes. She is taking a while.

185
00:11:43,458 --> 00:11:45,198
She must be washing thoroughly.

186
00:11:46,658 --> 00:11:49,098
- What? Thoroughly?
- When Hong Du gets back,

187
00:11:49,168 --> 00:11:50,168
should I just pass on what you said?

188
00:11:51,438 --> 00:11:52,438
What was it again?

189
00:11:52,498 --> 00:11:55,138
Hong Du is a blackmailer who knows your secret.

190
00:11:56,908 --> 00:11:59,478
And you lack comprehension skills.

191
00:11:59,538 --> 00:12:00,548
Right?

192
00:12:01,548 --> 00:12:04,648
When did I say I had a secret?

193
00:12:04,718 --> 00:12:06,988
Wow, you really have a habit...

194
00:12:07,048 --> 00:12:08,488
of misunderstanding people, don't you?

195
00:12:08,548 --> 00:12:11,918
By the way, are you Hong Du's employer?

196
00:12:11,988 --> 00:12:13,958
I have heard a lot about you.

197
00:12:14,028 --> 00:12:15,288
Is that so?

198
00:12:15,358 --> 00:12:18,058
Well, I have never heard a single thing about you.

199
00:12:19,098 --> 00:12:23,068
But have we met somewhere before?

200
00:12:23,128 --> 00:12:24,638
Your voice sounds very familiar...

201
00:12:26,338 --> 00:12:27,338
Hello...

202
00:12:37,148 --> 00:12:38,518
Excuse me, Hong Du?

203
00:12:38,578 --> 00:12:39,878
Have you never mentioned me to your employer?

204
00:12:39,948 --> 00:12:41,648
What?

205
00:12:41,718 --> 00:12:43,518
Why do you ask?

206
00:12:43,588 --> 00:12:46,458
Why are you being like this? My feelings are completely hurt.

207
00:12:47,958 --> 00:12:49,888
What? Well...

208
00:12:53,028 --> 00:12:54,898
We do not have a patient by that name.

209
00:12:54,968 --> 00:12:57,638
Cha Gil Dong, we do not have anyone by that name.

210
00:12:57,698 --> 00:12:59,138
I do not think so.

211
00:12:59,198 --> 00:13:01,308
There is no patient with that name.

212
00:13:01,368 --> 00:13:04,078
(Imje Dementia Nursing Hospital)

213
00:13:04,138 --> 00:13:06,138
(Emergency)

214
00:13:27,398 --> 00:13:30,238
Where did he go?

215
00:13:30,298 --> 00:13:32,068
She has been doing that all day.

216
00:13:34,338 --> 00:13:36,108
Why am I following her around?

217
00:13:37,408 --> 00:13:39,238
It is not like...

218
00:13:39,308 --> 00:13:41,008
I am going to let them meet.

219
00:13:42,008 --> 00:13:43,278
(Imje Dementia Nursing Hospital)

220
00:14:24,558 --> 00:14:27,058
- What are you doing?
- What do you think?

221
00:14:27,128 --> 00:14:28,328
I am doing nothing.

222
00:14:29,728 --> 00:14:31,498
Buy me some food.

223
00:14:31,558 --> 00:14:33,198
What?

224
00:14:33,258 --> 00:14:35,868
I am craving something so spicy it makes me cry.

225
00:14:37,368 --> 00:14:39,438
But I cannot go alone.

226
00:14:39,498 --> 00:14:40,668
Well...

227
00:14:40,738 --> 00:14:41,738
Sure.

228
00:14:53,788 --> 00:14:56,818
Right. Um Tae Bong told me not to cry.

229
00:14:58,258 --> 00:15:00,588
Even if something truly makes me want to cry,

230
00:15:00,658 --> 00:15:02,328
I just have to...

231
00:15:02,388 --> 00:15:03,628
pretend to be okay like this.

232
00:15:05,028 --> 00:15:06,158
Pretend to be okay.

233
00:15:10,968 --> 00:15:12,468
There you go again.

234
00:15:12,538 --> 00:15:14,408
Did I not tell you to always smile?

235
00:15:28,288 --> 00:15:30,388
I asked for spicy food, so why a restaurant?

236
00:15:31,418 --> 00:15:32,588
But are you not here yet?

237
00:16:05,688 --> 00:16:06,688
Father.

238
00:16:08,328 --> 00:16:09,328
Crazy woman.

239
00:16:09,388 --> 00:16:12,458
I really thought you were dead, Father.

240
00:16:12,528 --> 00:16:14,668
Where have you been all this time?

241
00:16:14,728 --> 00:16:17,298
Why did you abandon me?

242
00:16:17,368 --> 00:16:20,238
CEO Park, restroom. Why is he not coming?

243
00:16:20,308 --> 00:16:21,868
Father. It is me, Hong Du.

244
00:16:21,938 --> 00:16:24,608
- Your daughter, Hong Du, remember?
- Daughter?

245
00:16:24,678 --> 00:16:28,108
When I found out you were alive,

246
00:16:28,178 --> 00:16:32,548
I searched every single hospital trying to find you, you know?

247
00:16:34,718 --> 00:16:36,148
Crazy woman.

248
00:16:36,218 --> 00:16:37,688
Are you crying?

249
00:16:37,758 --> 00:16:40,688
Why do you keep calling me a crazy woman?

250
00:16:40,758 --> 00:16:41,828
Seriously.

251
00:16:42,988 --> 00:16:46,128
Why do you not remember me? Why?

252
00:16:46,198 --> 00:16:48,098
Are you really sick, Father?

253
00:16:48,168 --> 00:16:50,598
- Is that it?
- You should not cry.

254
00:16:51,668 --> 00:16:53,468
You should not cry.

255
00:16:53,538 --> 00:16:56,008
It drains your energy.

256
00:16:57,308 --> 00:16:58,738
Still, you should not have forgotten.

257
00:17:00,008 --> 00:17:03,848
You should remember your daughter, Hong Du, right?

258
00:17:03,918 --> 00:17:06,318
My daughter is Young Ji.

259
00:17:06,378 --> 00:17:07,748
It is Young Ji.

260
00:17:07,818 --> 00:17:09,888
I am your daughter.

261
00:17:09,948 --> 00:17:13,988
I am your daughter, Hong Du.

262
00:17:17,728 --> 00:17:18,828
You are not Hong Du.

263
00:17:19,898 --> 00:17:21,898
Will it really be okay?

264
00:17:21,968 --> 00:17:23,068
You are not Hong Du.

265
00:17:28,608 --> 00:17:30,908
Wait, we should bring...

266
00:17:30,978 --> 00:17:33,878
- Mr. Choi Gu here.
- Why? For what reason, man?

267
00:17:33,948 --> 00:17:36,848
If she thinks she confirmed he is alive,

268
00:17:36,908 --> 00:17:38,048
she will not cry anymore.

269
00:17:43,118 --> 00:17:46,018
It is not like he actually knows Cha Hong Du anyway,

270
00:17:46,088 --> 00:17:47,258
