278
00:18:08,478 --> 00:18:10,618
- My daughter, Hong Du.
- Daughter?

279
00:18:12,748 --> 00:18:15,618
- Hey, what do you mean, daughter?
- My daughter, Hong Du.

280
00:18:15,688 --> 00:18:17,588
Some patients forget reality...

281
00:18:17,658 --> 00:18:19,918
