thinking of Hong Du right now?

538
00:35:26,918 --> 00:35:28,588
Tae Bong,

539
00:35:28,648 --> 00:35:30,448
did you happen to eat flour-based food yesterday?

540
00:35:31,858 --> 00:35:33,018
You are so swollen.

541
00:35:35,188 --> 00:35:37,028
Is it obvious?

542
00:35:37,088 --> 00:35:39,428
You usually do not even drink water before a schedule.

543
00:35:39,498 --> 00:35:40,958
These are going to be used as photos...

544
00:35:41,028 --> 00:35:42,528
for the overseas interview, so what are you going to do?

545
00:35:42,598 --> 00:35:45,238
Even shading cannot cover it. What now?

546
00:35:47,238 --> 00:35:48,668
I know...

547
00:35:48,738 --> 00:35:50,838
Why did I do that?

548
00:35:50,908 --> 00:35:52,678
Why do I keep doing this?

549
00:35:55,608 --> 00:35:56,608
(Cha Hong Du)

550
00:36:01,918 --> 00:36:02,918
Yes?

551
00:36:02,988 --> 00:36:05,288
Well, I am going to wash my father,

552
00:36:05,358 --> 00:36:07,488
but someone told me not to touch just anything.

553
00:36:07,558 --> 00:36:09,488
Especially the things he cherishes.

554
00:36:11,358 --> 00:36:13,528
So,

555
00:36:13,598 --> 00:36:16,428
this soap in the bathroom. Is this also something you cherish?

556
00:36:16,498 --> 00:36:18,638
You are in my bathroom right now, right?

557
00:36:18,698 --> 00:36:20,638
That is my private bathtub, so absolutely...

558
00:36:22,168 --> 00:36:24,908
Wait. Wash who?

559
00:36:38,088 --> 00:36:40,988
You do not have to come help.

560
00:36:41,058 --> 00:36:43,728
I was only going to wash his hair.

561
00:36:43,788 --> 00:36:44,788
That girl.

562
00:36:44,858 --> 00:36:46,558
You should have said so earlier.

563
00:36:46,628 --> 00:36:47,858
Well, what should I do?

564
00:36:47,928 --> 00:36:50,798
- Should I do it even now?
- I am not okay with it.

565
00:36:50,868 --> 00:36:52,638
Are you a pervert? Peeping at someone taking a bath?

566
00:36:52,698 --> 00:36:54,598
My Hong Du is not a pervert.

567
00:37:04,148 --> 00:37:06,178
When did she...

568
00:37:06,248 --> 00:37:09,048
I did not have this in my bathroom.

569
00:37:09,118 --> 00:37:12,688
This was all planned. A father-daughter scam.

570
00:37:12,758 --> 00:37:13,758
Gosh.

571
00:37:16,328 --> 00:37:17,828
Here I go.

572
00:37:25,298 --> 00:37:28,668
You have aged a lot, sir.

573
00:37:28,738 --> 00:37:30,068
You are listening to me, right?

574
00:37:31,808 --> 00:37:32,908
Sir...

575
00:37:34,078 --> 00:37:35,648
Are you happy you found your daughter?

576
00:37:41,148 --> 00:37:42,148
I am sorry.

577
00:37:44,148 --> 00:37:46,818
I know I am doing you a great wrong,

578
00:37:48,288 --> 00:37:49,388
but that woman...

579
00:37:51,998 --> 00:37:53,228
keeps smiling.

580
00:37:54,628 --> 00:37:57,168
What did you say? I cannot hear you.

581
00:38:00,068 --> 00:38:04,038
Wow. The dead skin, it is coming off like noodles.

582
00:38:04,108 --> 00:38:06,708
Cha Hong Du does not need to make noodle soup.

583
00:38:08,348 --> 00:38:11,678
It hurts. You Hong Du Leech.

584
00:38:11,748 --> 00:38:14,678
Oh, come on. I told you I am not a Leech.

585
00:38:14,748 --> 00:38:17,288
Like father, like daughter, right?

586
00:38:17,348 --> 00:38:18,988
What a temper.

587
00:38:24,028 --> 00:38:27,328
Do you have any sense? Even if he is your father,

588
00:38:27,398 --> 00:38:29,498
you cannot just wash a grown man.

589
00:38:29,568 --> 00:38:33,638
Then what should I do? My father is so filthy.

590
00:38:33,698 --> 00:38:36,308
From now on, you can do it.

591
00:38:36,368 --> 00:38:38,678
I will give you...

592
00:38:38,738 --> 00:38:39,738
a full 30 dollars.

593
00:38:41,108 --> 00:38:42,648
I cannot do this anymore. I cannot.

594
00:38:42,648 --> 00:38:43,648
You,

595
00:38:43,648 --> 00:38:45,318
get out of my house right now.

596
00:38:45,378 --> 00:38:47,278
Oh, I cannot hear you. I cannot hear you.

597
00:38:47,348 --> 00:38:49,288
You might have let us in,

598
00:38:49,348 --> 00:38:52,118
- but we will leave when we want to.
- Hey, Cha Hong Du.

599
00:38:52,188 --> 00:38:53,288
Oh, why are you yelling?

600
00:38:53,358 --> 00:38:55,528
- You will startle my father.
- No yelling.

601
00:38:55,588 --> 00:38:58,398
- You will startle my Hong Du.
- Oh, sir.

602
00:38:58,458 --> 00:39:01,058
- Why do you keep taking her side...
- If you do not want to, fine.

603
00:39:01,128 --> 00:39:04,068
They say you should make money while you can.

604
00:39:04,128 --> 00:39:07,338
Who knows? You might become a total beggar overnight.

605
00:39:07,398 --> 00:39:09,138
When a good gig comes up,

606
00:39:09,208 --> 00:39:11,168
it is good to earn some cash in advance.

607
00:39:12,278 --> 00:39:14,678
I am crazy.

608
00:39:18,208 --> 00:39:19,378
I have no choice.

609
00:39:19,748 --> 00:39:22,348
I will just have to wash him myself.

610
00:39:25,158 --> 00:39:27,588
Make it 50 dollars, and not a penny less.

611
00:39:32,458 --> 00:39:35,568
He is actually negotiating.

612
00:39:35,628 --> 00:39:38,438
The rich are always the greediest.

613
00:39:44,168 --> 00:39:45,178
But Father,

614
00:39:46,438 --> 00:39:48,078
why do you keep calling him a leech?

615
00:39:49,748 --> 00:39:52,148
I am the real leech here.

616
00:39:52,218 --> 00:39:53,948
We are freeloading at Um Tae Bong's house.

617
00:39:56,248 --> 00:39:59,218
He might speak a bit rudely,

618
00:39:59,288 --> 00:40:02,688
but he is actually warm and kind.

619
00:40:02,758 --> 00:40:04,158
So please be nice to him, Father.

620
00:40:08,058 --> 00:40:09,068
And...

621
00:40:10,498 --> 00:40:11,498
Um Tae Bong is...

622
00:40:12,768 --> 00:40:14,638
sick just like you, Father.

623
00:40:14,698 --> 00:40:16,138
If he just gets a kiss,

624
00:40:16,208 --> 00:40:18,138
his mind goes blank and he cannot breathe.

625
00:40:20,138 --> 00:40:22,608
I do not know why he is like that, but...

626
00:40:26,278 --> 00:40:27,278
So...

627
00:40:28,488 --> 00:40:29,488
I feel a bit sorry for him.

628
00:40:47,268 --> 00:40:49,968
She is talking behind my back again.

629
00:40:51,438 --> 00:40:54,708
Oh, come on. I told you I am not a Leech.

630
00:40:54,778 --> 00:40:56,578
Like father, like daughter, right?

631
00:40:56,648 --> 00:40:59,218
What a temper.

632
00:40:59,218 --> 00:41:00,878
Wait,

633
00:41:00,878 --> 00:41:02,718
did I just call them father and daughter?

634
00:41:04,348 --> 00:41:05,858
Get a grip, Um Tae Bong.

635
00:41:08,218 --> 00:41:09,228
Still,

636
00:41:10,258 --> 00:41:12,158
I am glad he looks happy.

637
00:41:13,598 --> 00:41:14,598
Her, too.

638
00:41:15,628 --> 00:41:17,268
Even if it is fake,

639
00:41:17,268 --> 00:41:20,638
having someone to call father and daughter...

640
00:41:20,698 --> 00:41:21,698
Is that a good thing?

641
00:41:23,568 --> 00:41:25,538
(Hyun Joo)

642
00:41:27,608 --> 00:41:29,978
You like seafood stew.

643
00:41:30,048 --> 00:41:31,308
The blue crabs are really fresh today.

644
00:41:31,378 --> 00:41:33,478
No, I do not need to eat.

645
00:41:33,548 --> 00:41:37,418
- What?
- I mean...

646
00:41:37,488 --> 00:41:40,088
I am just not really in the mood for seafood stew today.

647
00:41:40,158 --> 00:41:41,618
Oh, really?

648
00:41:41,688 --> 00:41:43,758
Then I will make you something else.

649
00:41:43,828 --> 00:41:45,628
I bought a bunch of things.

650
00:41:45,698 --> 00:41:47,498
No, I am too tired.

651
00:41:48,628 --> 00:41:49,628
Seriously, next time.

652
00:41:50,768 --> 00:41:51,768
Is that right?

653
00:41:53,198 --> 00:41:54,738
Alright, get some rest then.

654
00:41:54,798 --> 00:41:56,508
We can have seafood stew next time.

655
00:41:56,568 --> 00:41:57,568
Yes.

656
00:42:15,558 --> 00:42:17,728
Darn it.

657
00:42:26,268 --> 00:42:27,338
I thought you were off today.

658
00:42:28,568 --> 00:42:31,338
Dong Seok, could you throw away the stuff in the car?

659
00:42:31,408 --> 00:42:32,908
I was going to make seafood stew, but...

660
00:42:34,378 --> 00:42:35,548
I guess the seafood was not fresh enough.

661
00:42:36,608 --> 00:42:38,078
It already smelled rotten on the way here.

662
00:42:44,888 --> 00:42:45,888
Let's see here.

663
00:42:49,028 --> 00:42:50,588
These are all Tae Bong's favourites.

664
00:43:02,908 --> 00:43:05,878
You idiot.

665
00:43:07,478 --> 00:43:08,508
What now?

666
00:43:19,318 --> 00:43:20,788
Oh, boy.

667
00:43:20,858 --> 00:43:22,758
Please take good care of my father.

668
00:43:22,828 --> 00:43:23,928
Oh, do not worry.

669
00:43:23,988 --> 00:43:25,958
More importantly, if that punk Tae Bong bothers you,

670
00:43:26,028 --> 00:43:27,058
tell me right away.

671
00:43:27,128 --> 00:43:28,358
He has a bad case of Celebrity Syndrome.

672
00:43:30,128 --> 00:43:32,398
- Celebrity Syndrome?
- Celebrity Syndrome, yes.

673
00:43:32,468 --> 00:43:33,468
Oh, please.

674
00:43:35,308 --> 00:43:37,938
Well then, I hope you remember my loyalty today...

675
00:43:38,008 --> 00:43:39,978
in the future.

676
00:43:40,038 --> 00:43:41,878
- Good luck.
- Good luck.

677
00:43:41,948 --> 00:43:43,608
Okay. Have a safe trip.

678
00:43:47,148 --> 00:43:48,748
It has been a while since your home was this lively...

679
00:43:48,818 --> 00:43:49,818
Feels good, right?

680
00:43:54,288 --> 00:43:56,958
Do I look like I feel good?

681
00:43:58,058 --> 00:44:00,658
- Right.
- How long do we have to keep up...

682
00:44:00,728 --> 00:44:03,868
- this Truman Show?
- Well, let's see...

683
00:44:03,928 --> 00:44:06,498
Until Hong Du's unpredictable brain returns to normal?

684
00:44:06,568 --> 00:44:09,268
Or until the day your secret can be revealed to the world...

685
00:44:09,338 --> 00:44:12,078
without causing any trouble, right?

686
00:44:12,138 --> 00:44:14,178
Hey, so keep a close eye on Hong Du.

687
00:44:14,238 --> 00:44:16,008
Do not get caught doing anything weird, okay?

688
00:44:16,008 --> 00:44:18,048
Good luck.

689
00:44:18,108 --> 00:44:21,678
Gosh, since when did the normal world...

690
00:44:21,748 --> 00:44:23,048
become so weird?

691
00:44:24,818 --> 00:44:25,818
Good luck.

692
00:44:32,258 --> 00:44:34,698
Hey, Do Seon Mi, do you know why he told me not to pick him up...

693
00:44:34,758 --> 00:44:36,598
- for the time being?
- No.

694
00:44:36,668 --> 00:44:38,098
Then my excuse to go inside the house...

695
00:44:38,168 --> 00:44:39,568
disappears.

696
00:44:39,638 --> 00:44:41,198
- Do you really not know anything?
- No.

697
00:44:41,268 --> 00:44:42,908
How do you not know a single thing?

698
00:44:42,968 --> 00:44:43,968
I know one thing.

699
00:44:46,338 --> 00:44:47,878
Be careful.

700
00:44:58,188 --> 00:44:59,558
I picked this up on the way...

701
00:44:59,618 --> 00:45:02,928
No, I met her. Seon Mi, the outfit?

702
00:45:02,988 --> 00:45:03,988
The one for the continuity.

703
00:45:05,258 --> 00:45:07,628
- Hello.
- Oh, my.

704
00:45:09,128 --> 00:45:11,528
- Okay.
- Read the scenes in order.

705
00:45:11,598 --> 00:45:14,238
- First is scene 39.
- Okay, continuity.

706
00:45:14,298 --> 00:45:15,638
And scene 42.

707
00:45:15,708 --> 00:45:17,708
- This outfit.
- Okay.

708
00:45:18,778 --> 00:45:20,878
(Favourite Character Is Cha Hong Du From "The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

709
00:45:22,448 --> 00:45:25,008
A ghost!

710
00:45:28,918 --> 00:45:29,918
Hey, you...

711
00:45:31,718 --> 00:45:34,618
- What are you doing?
- Practising my paper-eating trick.

712
00:45:34,688 --> 00:45:36,488
(Practising My Paper-Eating Trick)

713
00:45:41,328 --> 00:45:43,268
Man, it is really good since I have not had it in a while, right?

714
00:45:46,738 --> 00:45:50,268
Buy the medicine and open the door wide.

715
00:45:52,238 --> 00:45:53,938
- What is wrong with you?
- Are you okay?

716
00:45:54,008 --> 00:45:55,008
Are you okay?

717
00:45:57,078 --> 00:45:58,578
Drink some water.

718
00:45:58,648 --> 00:45:59,648
Are you okay?

719
00:46:02,248 --> 00:46:03,248
It is too spicy.

720
00:46:04,688 --> 00:46:05,688
Please turn off the TV.

721
00:46:10,528 --> 00:46:13,298
If you are tired, should I go buy you a cup of coffee?

722
00:46:13,358 --> 00:46:15,468
From that cafe you like.

723
00:46:15,528 --> 00:46:17,628
Okay. I will run and get it right now.

724
00:46:17,698 --> 00:46:18,698
I am fine.

725
00:46:21,038 --> 00:46:22,038
He is fine?

726
00:46:23,168 --> 00:46:24,168
What is fine?

727
00:46:25,168 --> 00:46:26,808
Why is he fine?

728
00:46:26,878 --> 00:46:28,438
What is this?

729
00:46:28,508 --> 00:46:29,648
Why is he not nagging me?

730
00:46:31,208 --> 00:46:33,218
Nagging means love?

731
00:46:34,678 --> 00:46:36,748
You think you have only been nagged all this time?

732
00:46:36,818 --> 00:46:38,648
That was all love.

733
00:46:39,718 --> 00:46:41,488
Though it is shifting to someone else now.

734
00:46:41,558 --> 00:46:44,688
Hey, is love some kind of virus? Why would it shift around?

735
00:46:44,758 --> 00:46:46,328
What would a kid like you know?

736
00:46:46,398 --> 00:46:48,928
That it is the most fatal virus in the world.

737
00:46:48,998 --> 00:46:50,668
We have lots of car scenes today, so there's a ton of work,

738
00:46:50,728 --> 00:46:52,368
and even reporters are here. I am exhausted.

739
00:46:52,438 --> 00:46:54,968
- I am exhausted.
- Reporters?

740
00:46:55,038 --> 00:46:56,238
- Yes.
- Hello.

741
00:46:57,308 --> 00:47:00,438
We are only going to overlay music for this scene.

742
00:47:00,508 --> 00:47:03,078
Just improvise the lines to create a sorrowful mood.

743
00:47:05,248 --> 00:47:06,818
What are you doing later?

744
00:47:06,878 --> 00:47:09,488
A new spicy chicken feet place opened in Cheongdam-dong.

745
00:47:09,548 --> 00:47:11,348
- Want to go?
- These days, I am...

746
00:47:12,958 --> 00:47:14,358
doing intermittent fasting.

747
00:47:16,258 --> 00:47:17,828
The car keys are in the ignition,

748
00:47:19,528 --> 00:47:21,158
so I really want to skip the shoot and go.

749
00:47:24,198 --> 00:47:25,228
This right now...

750
00:47:27,098 --> 00:47:29,068
is a very sad scene.

751
00:47:29,138 --> 00:47:30,138
Are you going to keep...

752
00:47:31,608 --> 00:47:33,578
talking nonsense?

753
00:47:33,638 --> 00:47:35,278
What does it matter?

754
00:47:35,338 --> 00:47:37,948
They will just play music over it and only show the visuals anyway.

755
00:47:38,008 --> 00:47:40,618
The emotion is great right now.

756
00:47:40,678 --> 00:47:42,148
See? He says it is great.

757
00:47:45,188 --> 00:47:47,288
What? Reporter Yeo Mi Ran is here.

758
00:47:56,828 --> 00:47:59,498
I do not know how Reporter Yeo Mi Ran caught on,

759
00:47:59,568 --> 00:48:02,638
but she knows that Hong Du knows your secret.

760
00:48:02,708 --> 00:48:05,608
She is going to find Hong Du and make her talk.

761
00:48:13,478 --> 00:48:14,478
(Restricted Area)

762
00:48:15,518 --> 00:48:16,518
What should I do?

763
00:48:18,748 --> 00:48:20,588
- Get out.
- What?

764
00:48:20,658 --> 00:48:22,528
Get out right now, hurry.

765
00:48:31,598 --> 00:48:32,598
Wait...

766
00:48:34,098 --> 00:48:36,008
Oh, hey!

767
00:48:37,068 --> 00:48:38,338
Where are you going?

768
00:48:38,408 --> 00:48:43,308
- Wow, impressive.
- Is Um Tae Bong out of his mind?

769
00:48:44,708 --> 00:48:46,578
I will write and send an article right now.

770
00:48:46,648 --> 00:48:47,648
Let us go.

771
00:48:58,458 --> 00:49:03,598
(Scandal Maker Um Tae Bong Even Deserts the Set)

772
00:49:08,398 --> 00:49:12,738
Where are you? The director is mad and the set is a total mess.

773
00:49:12,808 --> 00:49:16,478
Bravo. Have you finally lost your mind?

774
00:49:19,518 --> 00:49:21,218
(CEO Park)

775
00:49:23,448 --> 00:49:24,448
Yes?

776
00:49:24,448 --> 00:49:26,318
I heard Reporter Yeo Mi Ran showed up on set.

777
00:49:26,388 --> 00:49:28,358
For now, I said you got a call that your mother is critical...

778
00:49:28,418 --> 00:49:32,258
and acted impulsively, so play along if anyone asks.

779
00:49:35,768 --> 00:49:36,768
Oh, okay.

780
00:49:36,828 --> 00:49:38,028
Worst case scenario, let us say my secret...

781
00:49:38,098 --> 00:49:39,568
is completely exposed because of Cha Hong Du.

782
00:49:39,638 --> 00:49:41,168
So what?

783
00:49:41,238 --> 00:49:42,708
It means a hiatus or a downfall.

784
00:49:43,808 --> 00:49:44,808
It has to be one or the other.

785
00:49:47,338 --> 00:49:49,348
Did you go use the bathroom during the shoot?

786
00:49:49,408 --> 00:49:51,208
Stop hanging up and get here quickly.

787
00:49:54,078 --> 00:49:55,078
Then,

788
00:49:56,818 --> 00:49:58,918
she will realise that she is weird too.

789
00:50:00,218 --> 00:50:01,318
Darn it.

790
00:50:02,688 --> 00:50:05,258
Right? The best friend Tae Bong talked about on that show.

791
00:50:06,498 --> 00:50:09,598
But does he not look like a childhood dream crusher?

792
00:50:13,568 --> 00:50:16,108
You have been coming every day since last week.

793
00:50:18,008 --> 00:50:19,308
One ramyeon a day...

794
00:50:21,738 --> 00:50:23,578
will make you gain weight.

795
00:50:23,648 --> 00:50:25,648
From now on, only come exactly three times a week.

796
00:50:25,718 --> 00:50:26,718
- What?
- What?

797
00:50:28,778 --> 00:50:31,188
Wow, he is telling a customer not to come.

798
00:50:31,248 --> 00:50:34,088
I know, right? Oh, he is so charming.

799
00:50:34,158 --> 00:50:35,318
I will bring you a menu. Just a moment.

800
00:50:35,388 --> 00:50:36,488
Hey, I call dibs on him.

801
00:50:40,158 --> 00:50:42,698
By the way, when did you become a fan of Um Tae Bong?

802
00:50:42,768 --> 00:50:44,998
Since the day he received the Brave Citizen Award...

803
00:50:45,068 --> 00:50:47,998
